{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Get the full data of any node by its id: its fields as stored, with what the scene decides for it beside them (a wall's or a ceiling's resolvedHeight, and heightIsExplicit, false when it follows its storey; a wall's resolvedThickness; a door's or window's resolvedOpening, its floor and what it hangs from; the displayName a level or a floor plate is shown by); its ancestorIds, its parent first (a door's wall, then the level, the building, the site); and the scene materials (scene:<id>) its finishes use. A container's node lists its children as stored; any that name no node are listed again in missingChildIds. A node its schema rejects comes back as stored, with nothing derived (verify_scene says what is wrong).","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"id":{"description":"The node id.","minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["id"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_node","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"ancestorIds":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"materials":{"additionalProperties":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"material":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"preset":{"default":"custom","enum":["white","brick","concrete","wood","glass","metal","plaster","tile","marble","custom"],"type":"string"},"properties":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"color":{"default":"#ffffff","type":"string"},"metalness":{"default":0,"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"opacity":{"default":1,"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"roughness":{"default":0.5,"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"side":{"default":"front","enum":["front","back","double"],"type":"string"},"transparent":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"}},"required":["color","roughness","me